  "title": "Adobe and Google Integrate AI Tools for Creative and Productivity",
  "summary": "Adobe and Google have collaborated to integrate AI tools into their platforms, allowing users to access Adobe’s creative and productivity tools like Photoshop, Premiere, and Firefly while using Google services such as Drive, Gmail, and Acrobat. The partnership also extends to AI-powered features for Android apps.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Adobe and Google have launched a partnership to integrate AI tools into Adobe’s Firefly, allowing users to use Adobe’s creative capabilities on Google apps.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Adobe announced new AI-powered tools for Firefly at its Max conference, enabling users to take on recurring tasks.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Google and Adobe have introduced AI-powered features in Adobe’s Pixel and Watch 5 series, expanding the integration of AI tools across devices.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
